es">M.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Naeem</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">F.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Ghazy</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">A. S.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Kaddoum</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">G.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--> (<!--[--><!--[-->2024<!--]--><!--]-->). 
<!--[--><!--[-->State-of-the-art security schemes for the internet of underwater things: A holistic survey<!--]--><!--]-->. <!--[--><i class="References__source">IEEE Open J. Commun. Soc</i><!--]--><!--[--><!--[-->5<!--]--><!--]-->, <!--[--><!--[-->6561<!--]--><!--]-->–<!--[--><!--[-->6592<!--]--><!--]-->. doi: <!--[--><!--[-->10.1109/ojcoms.2024.3474290<!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul class="References__links"><li class="References__links__item"><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25079929" target="_blank" data-event="dt_articles-open_link-pubmed_abstract">Pubmed Abstract</a></li><li class="References__links__item"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/ojcoms.2024.3474290" target="_blank" data-event="dt_articles-open_link-cross_ref">CrossRef </a></li><li class="References__links__item"><a href="http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?author=N..%2BAdam&amp;author=M..%2BAli&amp;author=F..%2BNaeem&amp;author=A.%2BS..%2BGhazy&amp;author=G..%2BKaddoum&amp;publication_year=2024&amp;title=State-of-the-art%2Bsecurity%2Bschemes%2Bfor%2Bthe%2Binternet%2Bof%2Bunderwater%2Bthings%3A%2BA%2Bholistic%2Bsurvey&amp;journal=IEEE+Open+J.+Commun.+Soc&amp;volume=5&amp;pages=6561-6592" target="_blank" data-event="dt_articles-open_link-google_scholar">Google Scholar</a></li><li class="References__links__item References__links__item--viewInArticle"><a href="#B3a" class="Link Link--linkType Link--blue50 Link--medium Link--icon Link--arrowUpRight" data-event="dt_articles-view_in_article-reference"><span class="References__viewInArticleLabel">View reference in article</span></a></li></ul></div></li><li class="References__item" id="B4"><div class="References__label"><p>4</p></div><div class="References__content"><p class="notranslate"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span person-group-type="author" class="References__personGroup"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Ahsan</span><!--]-->